OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMist and fog will gradually
OL,6,Flift in the east to allow bright
OL,7,Fspells to develop, and generally
OL,8,Fsunnier in the west. Later, cloud will
OL,9,Fthicken from the northwest with the
OL,10,Fodd spot of rain developing. Staying
OL,11,Fmild in gentle winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FIt will be a rather cloudy
OL,14,Fnight with the odd patch of drizzle,
OL,15,Fthough some clearer spells are likely
OL,16,Fto arrive from the north towards dawn.
OL,17,FFrost-free with gentle winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
